WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.326
This course uses vw as a prefix for standard views
and mv for materialized views

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:12.589
PostgreSQL does not require that naming convention
The goal

00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:18.421
is readability and discoverability Whatever
convention a team chooses

00:00:18.671 --> 00:00:23.421
use it consistently and document the intended grain
and meaning of important shared objects
